---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { url } from '../utils/url';
---

<Layout title="Covid-19 Relief Initiative" description="How NavSahyog Foundation adapted its village programmes during the Covid-19 lockdown, and our relief work for 600+ households across 21 villages.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-paper">
    <div class="container-content pt-20 md:pt-28 pb-12">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span>Initiative</span></div>
      <h1 class="display text-fluid-5xl2 leading-[0.98] tracking-display-tight m-0 max-w-4xl">
        Adapting both the programme — <span class="display-italic text-accent">and</span> our response.
      </h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Headline numbers -->
  <section class="border-y border-line py-14">
    <div class="container-content grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
      <div>
        <div class="display text-fluid-4xl leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.045em] text-ink">600<span class="text-accent">+</span></div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] text-ink-2 max-w-[18rem] leading-snug">Households received kits with essential provisions during the first wave.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="display text-fluid-4xl leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.045em] text-ink">21</div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] text-ink-2 max-w-[18rem] leading-snug">Villages reached with relief — alongside the daily programme adaptations.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Long form -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="container-content max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-[18px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 m-0 mb-7">
        When the lockdown was announced, we quickly adapted our programme. We introduced strict Covid-appropriate safety norms for our team and the children: mask-wearing, hand-wash with soap before the start and end of daily activities, and maintaining safe distances.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[18px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 m-0 mb-7">
        We suspended all contact sports like Kho-Kho and Kabaddi; instead, we introduced yoga and meditation. Creative activities — storytelling, thumb painting, and the like — were retained. We taught all children how to make and wear masks.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[18px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 m-0 mb-7">
        During the first wave, the lockdown affected not only the school-going children in villages, but also severely impacted the livelihoods of several families. To mitigate this, we provided relief kits with essential provisions to <strong>more than 600 households across 21 villages</strong>.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[18px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2 m-0 mb-10">
        The document below gives a more detailed description of our Covid-19 relief initiatives.
      </p>

      <a
        href={url('/downloads/covid-related-initiatives.pdf')}
        class="btn-primary px-7 py-3.5"
      >
        Read the full PDF report ↓
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Videos -->
  <section class="pb-24 md:pb-32">
    <div class="container-content">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span>Field videos</span></div>
      <h2 class="display text-fluid-md2 leading-[1.05] tracking-display-tight m-0 mb-12 max-w-2xl">From the lockdown.</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <figure class="m-0">
          <div class="aspect-video bg-ink overflow-hidden">
            <iframe
              class="w-full h-full"
              src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/ikxrxhySN7o"
              title="Covid-19 Relief Initiative"
              allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
              allowfullscreen
              loading="lazy"
            ></iframe>
          </div>
          <figcaption class="label-mono tracking-label-08 text-ink-3 mt-3">Covid-19 Relief Initiative · Part 1</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="m-0">
          <div class="aspect-video bg-ink overflow-hidden">
            <iframe
              class="w-full h-full"
              src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/4fvoEeMH4vE"
              title="Covid-19 Relief Initiative"
              allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
              allowfullscreen
              loading="lazy"
            ></iframe>
          </div>
          <figcaption class="label-mono tracking-label-08 text-ink-3 mt-3">Covid-19 Relief Initiative · Part 2</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
